# Build context for services/agent/Dockerfile is the repo root. Allow-list only what the
# image needs, so .env, logs, .git and local worktrees never enter the context.
*
!services/agent/pyproject.toml
!services/agent/uv.lock
!services/agent/src
!data/sample
!zetaris/sql
!catalog
!input_examples
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
